          "id": 136,
          "start": 361.03,
          "end": 362.93,
          "en": "If I would use ease-out here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 362.93,
          "end": 364.77,
          "en": "we could of course also have merged it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 364.77,
          "end": 366.33,
          "en": "with this CSS rule,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 366.33,
          "end": 368.123,
          "en": "but I want to use ease-in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 369.37,
          "end": 371.5,
          "en": "So now, here I am reusing a little bit of code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 371.5,
          "end": 373.62,
          "en": "instead of writing everything twice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 373.62,
          "end": 375.91,
          "en": "I did it before to be more explicit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 375.91,
          "end": 377.7,
          "en": "but now I think we got the idea,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 377.7,
          "end": 379.59,
          "en": "so we can write less code here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 379.59,
          "end": 381.593,
          "en": "and now if I now save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 382.77,
          "end": 383.97,
          "en": "we got an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 383.97,
          "end": 386.74,
          "en": "Transition expects exactly one child element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 386.74,
          "end": 387.96,
          "en": "or an component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 387.96,
          "end": 390.95,
          "en": "Now, I just emphasized that it would be fine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 390.95,
          "end": 392.31,
          "en": "to have multiple elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 392.31,
          "end": 393.93,
          "en": "if we guarantee that only one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 393.93,
          "end": 395.424,
          "en": "is shown at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 395.424,
          "end": 396.685,
          "en": "Well, the problem is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 396.685,
          "end": 401.6,
          "en": "Vue doesn't understand that these If conditions here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 401.6,
          "end": 404.15999999999997,
          "en": "guarantee us that only one button is added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 404.15999999999997,
          "end": 407.233,
          "en": "It doesn't analyze the If conditions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 408.38,
          "end": 412.09000000000003,
          "en": "So, in order to give Vue a clear signal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 412.09000000000003,
          "end": 416.03,
          "en": "that it's either that or that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 416.03,
          "end": 418.76,
          "en": "we should use V-Else here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 418.76,
          "end": 420.61,
          "en": "because V-Else is pretty clear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 420.61,
          "end": 422.62,
          "en": "With V-Else, we guarantee",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 422.62,
          "end": 427.346,
          "en": "that only this or this component is shown,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 163,
          "start": 427.346,
          "end": 430.11,
          "en": "that we'll never have both on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 164,
          "start": 430.11,
          "end": 431.253,
          "en": "at the same time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 165,
          "start": 432.66,
          "end": 434.523,
          "en": "So, now with that added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 166,
          "start": 435.4,
          "end": 436.56,
          "en": "this works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 167,
          "start": 436.56,
          "end": 441.21,
          "en": "and now you see we have this smooth transition here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 168,
          "start": 441.21,
          "end": 443.33,
          "en": "when a button is removed, it fades out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 169,
          "start": 443.33,
          "end": 446,
          "en": "when it's added, it fades in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 170,
          "start": 446,
          "end": 447.69,
          "en": "but of course, it's also ugly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 171,
          "start": 447.69,
          "end": 451.2,
          "en": "because it jumps, and during the transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 172,
          "start": 451.2,
          "end": 453.69,
          "en": "we actually have both buttons on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 173,
          "start": 453.69,
          "end": 455.09000000000003,
          "en": "which by the way, is okay here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 174,
          "start": 455.09000000000003,
          "end": 457.313,
          "en": "because this is now controlled by Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 175,
          "start": 458.71,
          "end": 461.3,
          "en": "So, this is certainly not what we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 176,
          "start": 461.3,
          "end": 464.06,
          "en": "We want this fade transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 177,
          "start": 464.06,
          "end": 467.04,
          "en": "but we don't want both buttons at the same time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 178,
          "start": 467.04,
          "end": 468.22,
          "en": "on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 179,
          "start": 468.22,
          "end": 470.61,
          "en": "Instead, one button should fade out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 180,
          "start": 470.61,
          "end": 472.62,
          "en": "and then the other button should fade in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 181,
          "start": 472.62,
          "end": 474.25,
          "en": "that's the idea,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 182,
          "start": 474.25,
          "end": 476.93,
          "en": "and that's also something that you can control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 183,
          "start": 476.93,
          "end": 480.1,
          "en": "You can add the mode prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 184,
          "start": 480.1,
          "end": 481.91,
          "en": "to the transition component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 185,
          "start": 481.91,
          "end": 484.55,
          "en": "and mode knows two values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 186,
          "start": 484.55,
          "end": 487.36,
          "en": "in-out, and out-in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 187,
          "start": 487.36,
          "end": 489.43,
          "en": "and this controls whether first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 188,
          "start": 489.43,
          "end": 492.21,
          "en": "the leaving element should be animated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 189,
          "start": 492.21,
          "end": 494.77,
          "en": "or the new element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 190,
          "start": 494.77,
          "end": 496.713,
          "en": "So if I set this to in-out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 191,
          "start": 499.05,
          "end": 499.883,
          "en": "and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 192,
          "start": 499.883,
          "end": 501.94,
          "en": "we got the same behavior as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 193,
          "start": 501.94,
          "end": 503.68,
          "en": "or a similar behavior.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 194,
          "start": 503.68,
          "end": 505.51,
          "en": "Now, the addition of the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 195,
          "start": 505.51,
          "end": 507.02,
          "en": "is animated first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 196,
          "start": 507.02,
          "end": 508.793,
          "en": "and then the button is removed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 197,
          "start": 509.84,
          "end": 513.31,
          "en": "We can switch this to out-in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 198,
          "start": 513.31,
          "end": 515.45,
          "en": "and now we will have a better behavior,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 199,
          "start": 515.45,
          "end": 517.63,
          "en": "without in, if we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 200,
          "start": 517.63,
          "end": 520.69,
          "en": "Vue will first animate the removal of the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 201,
          "start": 520.69,
          "end": 522.33,
          "en": "and then animate the addition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 202,
          "start": 522.33,
          "end": 524.04,
          "en": "of the new button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 203,
          "start": 524.04,
          "end": 526.05,
          "en": "So, this allows you to control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 204,
          "start": 526.05,
          "end": 528.67,
          "en": "which element should be animated first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 205,
          "start": 528.67,
          "end": 531.37,
          "en": "instead of animating both at the same time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 206,
          "start": 531.37,
          "end": 535.06,
          "en": "which gave us this undesirable output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 207,
          "start": 535.06,
          "end": 537.88,
          "en": "Now, we're having a smooth animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 208,
          "start": 537.88,
          "end": 539.44,
          "en": "with help of transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 209,
          "start": 539.44,
          "end": 541.55,
          "en": "and multiple child elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 210,
          "start": 541.55,
          "end": 542.967,
          "en": "which is okay as you'll learn,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
